---
---

<section class="w-full bg-[#000000] text-white py-24 md:py-36 border-b border-white/10">
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-[700px] mx-auto text-center space-y-4 mb-20">
      <div class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand uppercase">BENCHMARK REPORT</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        稳定性，<br />
        比峰值速度更重要。
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-white/70 leading-relaxed">
        衡量现代化加速网络的指标不仅在于最高瞬间带宽，更在于 24 小时维度内的极低抖动与 SLA 级持续在线保障。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Data Visual Metrics -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Visual 1: Latency Jitter -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-sanmao-darkSecondary border border-white/10 space-y-4">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand">METRIC 01 • LATENCY JITTER</div>
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">延迟抖动控制</div>
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold font-mono text-white">
          &lt; 2 <span class="text-sm font-normal text-white/60">ms</span>
        </div>
        
        <!-- SVG Micro Chart -->
        <div class="h-16 w-full pt-4">
          <svg class="w-full h-full text-brand" viewBox="0 0 200 40" fill="none">
            <path d="M0 20 Q20 18 40 22 T80 19 T120 21 T160 20 T200 20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/50">极小抖动，确保实时音视频通话无延迟掉帧。</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual 2: Connection Stability -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-sanmao-darkSecondary border border-white/10 space-y-4">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand">METRIC 02 • DISCONNECT RATE</div>
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">连接持续稳定度</div>
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold font-mono text-white">
          99.98%
        </div>
        
        <!-- SVG Micro Chart -->
        <div class="h-16 w-full pt-4">
          <svg class="w-full h-full text-brand" viewBox="0 0 200 40" fill="none">
            <rect x="0" y="10" width="200" height="15" rx="4" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.05)" />
            <rect x="0" y="10" width="198" height="15" rx="4" fill="#00A88F" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/50">自动化 Keep-Alive 保活机制，减少突发断连。</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual 3: Server Availability -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-sanmao-darkSecondary border border-white/10 space-y-4">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand">METRIC 03 • SLA AVAILABILITY</div>
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">节点在线冗余</div>
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold font-mono text-white">
          24 / 7
        </div>
        
        <!-- SVG Micro Chart -->
        <div class="h-16 w-full pt-4 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-white/40 ml-2">ALL OK</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/50">多路跨国骨干节点冗余，故障自动无感切流。</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Mandatory Disclaimer -->
    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 text-center text-xs text-white/50">
      以下数据仅用于界面演示 Demo Benchmark，上线前替换为真实测试结果。
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
